---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import IndustryResources from '../../../components/IndustryResources.astro';
import QuillajaSelection from '../../../components/QuillajaSelection.astro';
import ApplicationTasks from '../../../components/ApplicationTasks.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="饮料用植物提取物：茶饮苦涩与甜菊后味" description="面向饮料研发与采购，比较茶饮苦味、涩感及甜菊苦后味与甜味拖尾，衔接原料供货形态、具体试配方案和样品需求。" lang="zh" heroTitle="饮料" heroSubtitle="从应用条件到采购规格">
<section id="plant-based-ingredients" class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">植物基饮料中的茶与草本配料</h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">燕麦饮料中，燕麦基底提供稠感，茶原料带来茶味与颜色。本页选型聚焦茶提取物、果实来源粉末和植物甜味配料；植物奶基底及乳化稳定体系需另行确定。</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">试配绿茶燕麦拿铁时，可溶性茶提取物先单独溶解，不套用叶粉调浆步骤。在实际蛋白质、盐和 pH 条件下设置基底空白，比较加工与储存后的砂感、沉淀再分散性及热处理后絮凝。枸杞果汁粉则对应另一类果味冲调饮料，重点是载体、复溶和颜色，不作为植物奶基底。</p>
<a class="inline-block mt-4 text-primary underline" href="/zh/plant-extracts/ingredients/green-tea#formulation-oat-latte">绿茶燕麦拿铁：原料分工与试配顺序 →</a>
</div></section>
<div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><p data-tea-family-discovery class="my-6"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/products/tea-extracts">绿茶、红茶与乌龙茶：速溶粉及浓缩液项目</a></p></div>
<QuillajaSelection lang="zh" />
<ApplicationTasks lang="zh" industry="beverages" />
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">植物原料应在实际饮料体系中评估，而非仅以水中表现判断。透明度、口味和储存表现取决于完整配方及工艺。</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">应用排查与验证</h2><div class="space-y-5">
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">浑浊或沉淀</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">在目标pH、水硬度和添加量下比较溶解与分散情况。更换原料前，排查载体、过滤和加料顺序的影响。</p></div>
<div id="tea-bitterness-astringency" class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">茶饮苦味、涩感与颜色变化</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">苦味是味觉，涩感是口腔干燥、收敛的感觉，试配时应分别记录。在相同水质、酸味和甜味体系中比较绿茶提取物样品及添加量，避免将原料差异与基底变化混为一谈。热处理后及储存期间，在目标包装中复查苦味、涩感与颜色。</p><a class="inline-block mt-3 text-primary underline" href="/zh/plant-extracts/ingredients/green-tea#formulation-citrus-tea">绿茶柑橘茶试配：加料顺序与苦涩评价 →</a></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">工艺不匹配</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">中试应覆盖巴氏杀菌或热灌装条件。由配方与质量团队评估保质期及微生物控制。</p></div>
</div><div class="mt-10 p-8 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">准备哪些信息？</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">饮料类型、pH、加工温度及时间、透明度目标、添加量和目标市场。</p><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">请同时提供产品、首单数量及所需文件。规格、样品和文件以实际可提供情况为准；认证及合规性需按产品和市场核查。以下建议为评估方向，不是配方或适用性保证。</p><a href="/zh/request-quote?request=application&amp;source=beverages&amp;application=beverages" class="inline-block mt-5 px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">提交应用需求</a><a href="/zh/resources/downloads" class="inline-block mt-5 ml-4 text-primary underline">查看采购清单</a></div>
</div></section>
<section data-hibiscus-research class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/hibiscus-color-endpoints">洛神花颜色：外观与色素含量是不同指标</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">洛神花复配果汁研究阅读：区分色度坐标与单体花色苷测定。</p></div></section>
<IndustryResources lang="zh" industry="beverages" />
</PageLayout>
